Moreno, providing him with room and board at the house that Martin was set to reside during his stay in town.

14
01:16:13,333 --> 01:16:19,333
Finding solace with his new persona, the drifter soon finds himself with a growing congregation at the church, drawing suspicion from the
town's prejudiced police chief, John Moore, portrayed by Michael Shannon, who is also having a secret affair with Celia.

